#: miniworlds.worlds.hex_world.hex_world.HexWorld:1 of
msgid "A world that consists of hexagonal tiles."
msgstr ""

#: miniworlds.worlds.hex_world.hex_world.HexWorld:3 of
msgid ""
"Hexes are addressed with offset coordinates `(column, row)`, like tiles "
"in a TiledWorld. Odd rows are shifted half a hex to the right (pointy-top"
" layout). Actors can also be placed on corners (shared by up to three "
"hexes) or edges (shared by two hexes)."
msgstr ""

